        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual game with strategic depth—easy to learn with zero entry barrier, but challenging to master when it comes to maximizing your gains.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play</strong><br>Spend Golden Eggs to enter, pick your Lucky Cards, and watch as the game automatically deals and clears cards. Earn rewards based on how many matches you make!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Randomness</strong><br>The deck-building aspect contains no randomness—all items and reward mechanisms are clear from the start. Your deck isn't influenced by luck; your strategic choices determine everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose &amp; Upgrade Lucky Cards</strong><br>There are 9 Lucky Cards, each with unique rewards. Unlock their upgraded forms by meeting certain conditions to gain even more powerful ultimate effects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan Your Optimal Path</strong><br>Each card enhances a different aspect of your run. Which reward to take first, which card to upgrade first—every decision counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim for a New High Score</strong><br>Use the bonuses from your Lucky Cards to refine your strategy, build your deck, make smarter decisions, and push your high score further every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Assets:</strong>Cup Nooble</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Assets</strong>:Abstraction,JDSherbert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Thanks:</strong>Yukaio,Kano,Wy</p></li></ul>",
